{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"EZK","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"以西結書","commonName":"以西結書","title":"以西結書","order":26,"numberOfChapters":48,"sha256":"12baf83f738d213fc8fcfdfb80ed9077bac361d38fc0165824d98cb7b59e53b9","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/EZK/1.json","lastChapterNumber":48,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/EZK/48.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1270},"chapter":{"number":31,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["以香柏樹比擬埃及"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["十一年三月初一日，耶和華的話臨到我說："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["「人子啊，你要向埃及王法老和他的眾人說：",{"text":"在威勢上誰能與你相比呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"亞述王曾如黎巴嫩中的香柏樹，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"枝條榮美，影密如林，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"極其高大，樹尖插入雲中。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"眾水使它生長；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"深水使它長大。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所栽之地有江河圍流，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"汊出的水道延到田野諸樹。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以它高大超過田野諸樹；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"發旺的時候，枝子繁多，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因得大水之力枝條長長。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"空中的飛鳥都在枝子上搭窩；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"田野的走獸都在枝條下生子；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所有大國的人民都在它蔭下居住。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"樹大條長，成為榮美，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為根在眾水之旁。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"上帝園中的香柏樹不能遮蔽它；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"松樹不及它的枝子；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"楓樹不及它的枝條；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"上帝園中的樹都沒有它榮美。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我使它的枝條蕃多，成為榮美，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以致上帝伊甸園中的樹都嫉妒它。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["所以主耶和華如此說：「因它高大，樹尖插入雲中，心驕氣傲，"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["我就必將它交給列國中大有威勢的人；他必定辦它。我因它的罪惡，已經驅逐它。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["外邦人，就是列邦中強暴的，將它砍斷棄掉。它的枝條落在山間和一切谷中，它的枝子折斷，落在地的一切河旁。地上的眾民已經走去，離開它的蔭下。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["空中的飛鳥都要宿在這敗落的樹上，田野的走獸都要臥在它的枝條下，"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["好使水旁的諸樹不因高大而自尊，也不將樹尖插入雲中，並且那些得水滋潤、有勢力的，也不得高大自立。因為它們在世人中，和下坑的人都被交與死亡，到陰府去了。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["主耶和華如此說：「它下陰間的那日，我便使人悲哀。我為它遮蓋深淵，使江河凝結，大水停流；我也使黎巴嫩為它悽慘，田野的諸樹都因它發昏。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["我將它扔到陰間，與下坑的人一同下去。那時，列國聽見它墜落的響聲就都震動，並且伊甸的一切樹－就是黎巴嫩得水滋潤、最佳最美的樹－都在陰府受了安慰。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["它們也與它同下陰間，到被殺的人那裏。它們曾作它的膀臂，在列國中它的蔭下居住。"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["在這樣榮耀威勢上，在伊甸園諸樹中，誰能與你相比呢？然而你要與伊甸的諸樹一同下到陰府，在未受割禮的人中，與被殺的人一同躺臥。 「法老和他的群眾乃是如此。這是主耶和華說的。」"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/EZK/31.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/EZK/32.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/EZK/30.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":18}